<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo adds 500 mln mark to Feb 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo adds 500 mln mark to Feb 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYOTHEKENBANKBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    25.FEB.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.375    PAY DATE    29.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.50 BP  REOFFER    97.17     SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINAL LAUNCHED 14.FEB.97, SIZE NOW 2.0 BLN DEM</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12 BP     SELL CONC  20.5 BP   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
